  "verseCount": 34,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "13",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1KI 13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ngʼat Nyasaye moa Juda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaluwore gi wach Jehova Nyasaye, ngʼat Nyasaye nobiro koa Juda modhi Bethel e kinde mane Jeroboam ochungʼ e but kendo mar misango mondo ochiw misango.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Noywak kokwongʼo kendo misangono kaluwore gi wach Jehova Nyasaye: \"Yaye kendo mar misango! Yaye kendo mar misango! Ma e gima Jehova Nyasaye wacho, 'Wuowi miluongo ni Josia ibiro nywol e od Daudi. Kuomi e nochiwe jodolo mag kuonde motingʼore makoro chiwo misengini kuomi, kendo choke dhano ibiro wangʼ kuomi.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chiengʼ nogono ngʼat Nyasayeno nochiwo ranyisi: \"Ma e ranyisi ma Jehova Nyasaye osechiwo: Kendo mar misango biro barore diere ariyo kendo buru man kuome biro pukore oko.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kane ruoth Jeroboam owinjo kaka ngʼat Nyasayeno noywak kokwongʼo kendo mar misango man Bethel norieyo bade kowuok e kendo mar misango kowacho niya, \"Makeuru!\" To bade mane orieyono kochomo ngʼat Nyasayeno notal mane ok onyal dole.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kendo mar misangono bende nobarore diere ariyo kendo buru mage nopukore oko kaluwore gi ranyisi mane ochiw gi ngʼat Nyasaye kod Wach Jehova Nyasaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eka ruoth nowacho ni ngʼat Nyasayeno niya, \"Kwana Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachi kendo lamna mondo lweta odog kare.\" Kamano ngʼat Nyasayeno nokwayone Jehova Nyasaye kendo lwet ruoth nodok kare kaka ne en.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ruoth nowacho ni ngʼat Nyasayeno niya, \"Wadhi oda mondo iyud gimoro icham kendo abiro miyi mich.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To ngʼat Nyasaye nodwoko ruoth niya, \"Kata ne bed mana ni inyalo miya nus mwanduni duto ok anadhi kodi kata chamo chiemo kata modho pi ka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimar nochika gi wach Jehova Nyasaye ni, 'Kik ichiem kata modho pi kata dok gi yo mane ibirogo.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kamano nokawo yo machielo mine ok odok gi yo mane obirogo Bethel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koro ne nitie janabi moro moti mane odak Bethel ma yawuote nobiro mowachone duto mane ngʼat Nyasayeno otimo kanyo chiengʼno, bende neginyiso wuon-gi gima nowacho ni ruoth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wuon-gi nopenjogi niya, \"Noluwo yo mane?\" To yawuote nonyise yo mane ngʼat Nyasaye moa Juda noluwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kamano nowacho ni yawuote niya, \"Gawnauru punda.\" Kane gisegawone punda, noidhe",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mi noluwo bangʼ ngʼat Nyasayeno. Noyude kobet e tiend yiend ober mopenje niya, \"In e ngʼat Nyasaye mane oa Juda?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "1KI 13:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nodwoke niya, \"Ee en an.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kamano janabi nowachone niya, \"Wadhi dala mondo ichiem.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngʼat Nyasayeno nowacho niya, \"Ok anyal lokora ma adog kodi dala kata chiemo kata modho pi kodi ka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Osenyisa kaluwore gi wach Jehova Nyasaye ni, 'Kik ichiem kata kik imodh pi kanyo kata idog gi yo mane ibirogo.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To janabi motino nodwoke niya, \"An bende an janabi mana kaka in. Kendo malaika nowuoyo koda gi wach Jehova Nyasaye kawachona ni, 'Duog kode e odi mondo mi ochiem kendo omodh pi.' \" To kata kamano nowuonde.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kamano ngʼat Nyasaye noduogo kode mochiemo kendo metho e ode.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kane gibedo e mesa gichiemo, wach Jehova Nyasaye nobiro ni janabi moticha mane odwogo chien.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Noywak ne ngʼat Nyasaye mane oa Juda mowacho niya, \"Ma e gima Jehova Nyasaye wacho: 'Isedagi winjo wach Jehova Nyasaye kendo ok iserito chik mane Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachi omiyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nidwogo chien mi ichamo makati kendo imodho pi kama nowachoni ni kik ichiemie kata modhoe pi. Omiyo ringri ok enoyiki e kar yiko mar kwereni.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kane ngʼat Nyasayeno otieko chiemo kendo metho, janabi mane odwoge chienno nogawone pundane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kane en e yore odhi, sibuor noromo kode e yo monege kendo ringe nowit piny e yo, ka punda kod sibuor ochungʼ bute.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jomoko mane kadho machiegni noneno ringreno kowit piny kanyo, ka sibuor ochungʼ but ringruokno kendo negidhi mi gilando wachno e dala mane janabi moticha odakie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kane janabi mane odwoge chien e wuodhe owinjo ma nowacho niya, \"En ngʼat Nyasaye mane ochayo wach Nyasaye. Jehova Nyasaye osechiwe ni sibuor mosekidhe kendo onege mana kaka wach Jehova Nyasaye nosesieme.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Janabi nowachone yawuote niya, \"Gawnauru punda kendo negitimo kamano.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eka nowuok modhi oyudo ringruokno kowit piny e yo ka punda gi sibuor ochungʼ bute. Sibuor ne ok ochamo ngʼatno kata kidho punda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kamano janabino nokawo ringre ngʼat Nyasayeno mokete e ngʼe punda kendo nodwoge e dalane mondo oywage kendo oike.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eka noketo ringreno e kar bure owuon mi giywage kagiwacho niya, \"Yaye, owadwa!\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bangʼ yike nowacho ni yawuote niya, \"Katho to ikauru e bur kama oyikie ngʼat Nyasayeni; keturu chokena but chokene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikech wach mane owacho kuluworegi wach Jehova Nyasaye kuom kendo mar misango man Bethel kendo kwongʼ mane okwongʼogo kuonde duto motingʼore malo mitimoe misango manie dala man Samaria biro chopo kare.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kata mana bangʼ ma, Jeroboam ne ok oloko yorene maricho to nomedo yiero jodolo koa kuom ji mopogore opogore mondo oti kuonde motingʼore. Ngʼato angʼata mane dwaro bedo jadolo nowalo ni kuonde motingʼore.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma e richo mar od Jeroboam mane omiyo opodho kendo kelone kethruok e wangʼ piny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
